<div><Nav /><section class="section hero hero--aboutus hero-aboutus_v2"><div class="container__01"><div class="hero-wrapper align-top"><div class="hero-content"><h1 class="h1-heading">Meet the Team</h1><p class="paragraph__19 margin-64 hero mb-0">Get to know our team: experienced, dedicated, and passionate about your rights and justice.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section teams"><div class="container__01"><div class="list-wrapper"><div role="list" class="collection-list-10 list-items"><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="div-block-6 team-item"><div class="fade-in-up"><img src="/images/ted_wacker_headshot.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/ted_wacker_headshot-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/ted_wacker_headshot-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/ted_wacker_headshot.jpg 860w" class="team_image _w-full"></div><div id="grid-102"><h2 class="h1-heading mb-0">Ted B. Wacker</h2><div class="team_position">FOUNDING PARTNER</div><p class="team_paragraph">Ted Wacker has been litigating for over 30 years and specializes in catastrophic injury cases, including personal injury cases involving accidents.</p><a href="/team/ted-b-wacker" class="button is--orange inline-block"><div class="button__wrapper"><div>Learn More</div><img src="/images/Btn-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="button__arrow"></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="div-block-6 team-item"><div class="fade-in-up"><img src="/images/vince_howard_01nb.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/vince_howard_01nb-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/vince_howard_01nb.jpg 600w" class="team_image _w-full"></div><div id="grid-102"><h2 class="h1-heading mb-0">Vincent D. Howard</h2><div class="team_position">PARTNER</div><p class="team_paragraph">Vincent D. Howard is a trial attorney that primarily focuses on representing Californians who have been personally or catastrophically injured because of the negligence of others.</p><a href="/team/vincent-d-howard" class="button is--orange inline-block"><div class="button__wrapper"><div>Learn More</div><img src="/images/Btn-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="button__arrow"></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="div-block-6 team-item"><div class="fade-in-up"><img src="/images/TBW_149_nb_sm-1.png" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/TBW_149_nb_sm-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/TBW_149_nb_sm-1.png 601w" class="team_image _w-full"></div><div id="grid-102"><h2 class="h1-heading mb-0">Bobby Waltman</h2><div class="team_position">PARTNER</div><p class="team_paragraph">Bobby Waltman has extensive litigation, negotiation, and trial experience, including over 28 jury trials to verdict. He is committed to obtaining maximum possible compensation through aggressive and compassionate representation of his clients.</p><a href="/team/bobby-waltman" class="button is--orange inline-block"><div class="button__wrapper"><div>Learn More</div><img src="/images/Btn-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="button__arrow"></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="div-block-6 team-item"><div class="fade-in-up"><img src="/images/TBW_126_nb_sm-1.png" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/TBW_126_nb_sm-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/TBW_126_nb_sm-1.png 601w" class="team_image _w-full"></div><div id="grid-102"><h2 class="h1-heading mb-0">Douglas S. Wacker</h2><div class="team_position">Managing Partner | Washington Office</div><p class="team_paragraph">Douglas Wacker is a trial attorney that primarily focuses on personal injury, criminal defense, and civil rights cases. He is an experienced trial attorney with both felony and misdemeanor cases to verdict before juries.</p><a href="/team/douglas-s-wacker" class="button is--orange inline-block"><div class="button__wrapper"><div>Learn More</div><img src="/images/Btn-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="button__arrow"></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="div-block-6 team-item"><div class="fade-in-up"><img src="/images/roxy_port1.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/roxy_port1-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/roxy_port1.jpg 600w" class="team_image _w-full"></div><div id="grid-102"><h2 class="h1-heading mb-0">Roxy S. Shekarriz</h2><div class="team_position">ATTORNEY</div><p class="team_paragraph">Roxy S. Shekarriz, Esq. is a formidable presence in the civil litigation arena, with a dynamic
practice that spans personal injury, products liability, mass torts, employment law, and childhood
and minor sexual assault.</p><a href="/team/roxy-s-shekarriz" class="button is--orange inline-block"><div class="button__wrapper"><div>Learn More</div><img src="/images/Btn-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="button__arrow"></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section attorneys"><div class="container__01"><div class="center-wrapper"><h2 class="h2-heading fade-up">TBW Legal Team</h2><div class="list-wrapper"><div role="list" class="attorneys-wrapper list-items"><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/Tobin-Apple-1.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Tobin-Apple-1-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/Tobin-Apple-1.jpg 700w"><div class="attorney-name">Tobin Apple</div><div class="attorney-position is-hidden"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/23895_1.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/23895_1-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/23895_1.jpg 700w"><div class="attorney-name">Jayna Bosse</div><div class="attorney-position is-hidden"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/23895_3.jpg" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Nancy De La Cruz</div><div class="attorney-position is-hidden"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/Tarrah-Lawrence_1.jpg" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Tarrah Lawrence</div><div class="attorney-position is-hidden"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/23895_60.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/23895_60-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/23895_60.jpg 700w"><div class="attorney-name">Sonia Saba</div><div class="attorney-position is-hidden"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/23895_4.jpg" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Dan Shah</div><div class="attorney-position is-hidden"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/Jenni-Teran-1.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Jenni-Teran-1-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/Jenni-Teran-1.jpg 700w"><div class="attorney-name">Jenni Teran</div><div class="attorney-position is-hidden"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/23895_2.jpg" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Sandra West</div><div class="attorney-position is-hidden"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="attorneys-wrapper hidden"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/TBW_308_nb_sm-1.png" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Firstname Lastname</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div><div id="grid-103" class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/TBW_181A_nb_sm-1.png" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Firstname Lastname</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/TBW_232_nb_sm-1.png" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Firstname Lastname</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/TBW_186_nb_sm-1.png" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Firstname Lastname</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/TBW_308_nb_sm-1.png" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Firstname Lastname</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div><div id="grid-104" class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/TBW_181A_nb_sm-1.png" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Firstname Lastname</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/TBW_232_nb_sm-1.png" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Firstname Lastname</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/TBW_186_nb_sm-1.png" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Firstname Lastname</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div></div></div></div></section><Footer /></div>




